potential of a fixer-upper with live material swaps and layout changes during the showing.", "short_description": "See It Before You Build It. Aria Spark transforms your Meta Quest into a spatial design studio. Powered by AI and real-time depth mapping, it turns any room into a live canvas where you can visualize changes, test ideas, and make confident decisions before you buy, build, or hire."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ariaspark.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aria Spark", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ariaspark.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24187840534244504"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "970725692141627"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "970725692141627"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1775062800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "970725692141627"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26699847176377148", "version": "0.2.1"}, "id": "1081615133956248", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "bina